# What never reaches the website.
#
# This is a static deployment: with no build step, Vercel uploads the
# repository and serves it, so any file left here is a public URL whether or
# not a page links to it. That is fine for pages, stylesheets and /data/, and
# wrong for everything below.
#
# supabase/ is the reason this file exists. It holds edge-function source, the
# deployment notes, and supabase/seed/sambal-tina-uncertain.json — the
# dictionary readings deliberately withheld from the published collection.
# Withholding them from data/ and then serving them from another path would
# achieve nothing.
supabase/

# Build and verification tooling. Nothing here is fetched by a browser, and the
# QA scripts describe how the checks can be defeated.
scripts/

# Working notes, not site content. BUILD-NOTES.md carries the internal
# provenance of the source archive; none of these is linked from any page.
*.md
